yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:116:arbitrated above the stream, by leases over datoms (§7.7), exactly where\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:122:(§7.3.4, §7.7). Conflating them was a defect of the first draft; this draft\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:146: :yin.k/occurrence  :yin.k/o-…                  ; §7.7    the checkpoint occurrence — the lease subject\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:150: :yin.k/arbitration {:dao.stream/identity … :dao.stream/descriptor …}     ; §7.7.3  the authority medium, named in the value\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:158: :yin.k/policy      :yin.k/exclusive}          ; §7.7  or :yin.k/fork\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:166:(`:yin.k/policy`, `:yin.k/occurrence`, with the custody facts of §7.7 on\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:200:historical**: the custody, fencing and operation-id semantics (§7.7.8,\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:201:§7.9, §7.4.3's operation ids) travel in version 3 as the root's\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:245: ;; when the task holds live install children (7.4.3)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:254:`pending` is one variant of 7.4.3. Every value is in the 7.5 grammar.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:263:  `:parked` alike; a resumer never drops a carried frame (7.4.3).\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:277:`:op-seq-exhausted` (7.4.3).\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:321: :yin.k/occurrence  O           ; the lease subject, 7.3.4 and 7.7.2\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:323:                     :dao.stream/descriptor d}     ; 7.7.3\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:327: :yin.k/next-op-seq n}          ; 7.7.8\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:355:- `:yin.k/next-op-seq` is an exact integer of 7.7.8. It is